# =============================================================================
# services/realtime — environment. Copy to .env for local work; on a host these
# are set in the dashboard or with `fly secrets set`.
#
# The service REFUSES TO BOOT without the first two. See src/config.ts for why
# that is better than starting and rejecting every connection.
# =============================================================================

# REQUIRED. Must be byte-identical to REALTIME_SHARED_SECRET on the Next.js
# deployment — every handshake token is verified against it. At least 32
# characters. Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 32
REALTIME_SHARED_SECRET=

# REQUIRED. Comma-separated EXACT origins allowed to open a socket. Not "*" —
# this socket carries a class's private conversation. Trailing slashes are
# stripped for you; a browser's Origin header never has one.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-app.vercel.app,http://localhost:3000
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000

# OPTIONAL. Absent means the IN-MEMORY store: chat and Q&A work live and nothing
# persists. Logged loudly at boot. Use the same Neon connection string as the
# Next app.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host/db?sslmode=require

# OPTIONAL. Injected automatically by Railway and Render. Fly needs it set (see
# fly.toml). Defaults to 4001.
# PORT=4001

# OPTIONAL. debug | info | warn | error. Defaults to info.
# LOG_LEVEL=info

# OPTIONAL. Simultaneous sockets one user may hold in one class. Two tabs is
# normal; the cap exists so a client with a reconnect bug cannot exhaust the
# process's file descriptors. Defaults to 4.
# MAX_SOCKETS_PER_USER=4

# OPTIONAL. How long an engagement record is held in memory with no activity
# before it is flushed and evicted, in MILLISECONDS. Read by src/config.ts.
# Defaults to 1800000 (30 minutes) — comfortably longer than a class.
# ENGAGEMENT_IDLE_TTL_MS=1800000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TESTS ONLY. Never set this on a deployed host.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Connection string for the Postgres STORE CONTRACT SUITE
# (src/store/contract.test.ts). The suite is SKIPPED unless this is set, and as
# of 2026-08-01 it has NEVER BEEN RUN — the 135 passing tests all exercise the
# in-memory store. The Postgres store is therefore verified by reading only.
#
# Point it at a THROWAWAY database that already has the app's migrations
# applied: the suite writes rows and truncates on teardown. Do NOT point it at
# the database in DATABASE_URL above.
# REALTIME_TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host/scratch?sslmode=require
